comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-14T01:58:48.803Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check across all PM statuses: searched GH-1004, the exact issue title, 2026.8.7/2026.8.13 repair loops, writer-version hash chains, and reviewed pm-2htk4p plus history-repair lineage. pm-2htk4p/#976 established explicit epochs and newer-reader compatibility, but #1004 is a fresh post-fix reproduction where two supported writers still do not converge. This item is the canonical regression; it remains open and unclaimed because this release closeout does not implement it."
  "2026-08-14T23:25:40.421Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-15: active in the coupled workspace-integrity tranche spanning provenance repair, self-indexing health severity, extension-host version coherence, cross-version history repair, and strict linked-artifact parsing. Only these five canonical regression items are claimed; all other tracker work remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-08-15T01:56:44.241Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-08-15: history replay detects a consistent hash epoch, preserves implicit v1 streams, reanchors with the detected epoch, and reports before/after version disposition so repairs converge across writer releases. Focused linked tests passed 26/26; full release verification passed static quality, secrets, 7,334 tests, and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-08-15T02:27:43.860Z","harness:codex","Timestamp clarification: implementation start was 2026-08-15 Europe/Vienna; the canonical PM event timestamp remains 2026-08-14T23:25:40.421Z UTC. This append-only clarification preserves the original event while making the project timezone explicit."
  "2026-08-15T02:58:02.914Z","harness:codex","PR #1016 review evidence 2026-08-15: history repair receipts now derive version_disposition from explicit epoch evidence, preserving unambiguous broken legacy/current streams and reserving selected_for_ambiguous_stream for mixed explicit epochs. New drift and mixed-receipt controls pass; focused tests and exact 7,337-test 100/100/100/100 coverage pass."
  "2026-08-15T03:01:39.888Z","harness:codex","Final review evidence: linked history contracts passed 28/28 tests. Consistent explicit writer epochs remain repairable and mixed epochs emit ambiguous disposition."
